sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver
    participant Edge as Edge Agent
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Notif as Notification
    participant Bot as AI Chatbot

    Note over Edge: Vehicle approaches entry camera
    Edge->>Edge: motion -> YOLOv11 -> plate -> OCR -> track -> slot
    Edge->>API: POST /ingest/events (VehicleEntered, eventId)
    API->>DB: persist event + outbox (one tx)
    API-->>Edge: 200 delivered
    API->>Bus: relay event
    Bus->>DB: projector updates Vehicle.current_slot
    Note over Edge: Later, vehicle moves slots
    Edge->>API: POST /ingest/events (VehicleRelocated)
    API->>Bus: relay event
    Bus->>Notif: build alert
    Notif-->>Driver: push "Xe cua ban da bi di chuyen"
    Driver->>Bot: "Xe toi dang o dau?"
    Bot->>API: getVehicleLocation() (tenant-scoped)
    API-->>Bot: slot B12, 09:35, snapshot
    Bot-->>Driver: "Xe 51A-12345 dang o o B12, ghi nhan 09:35"
